{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04559","headline":"赠赵侍御 · 张说","name":"赠赵侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禄放迹异端，偏荒事同蹇。\n苟忘风波累，俱会云壑践。\n险式压西湖，侨庐对南岘。\n夜楼江月入，朝幌山云卷。\n山势远涛连，江途斜汉转。\n坐啸予多暇，行吟子独善。\n并辔躧郊郭，方舟玩游演。\n虚声万籁分，水色千里辨。\n不知岸阴谢，再见春露泫。\n绿壤发欣颜，华年助虫篆。\n上世时难接，古人情可选。\n泊渚烦爲媒，多才怨成褊。\n长沙鵩作赋，任道可知浅。\n请从三已心，荣辱两都遣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}